elines Screenshot (1).png", "id": "3915626092078551", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296127_3915626095411884_5364719753103044987_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ji7vWWyUnYMQ7kNvwHLBp-P&_nc_oc=Adpxn3-MZy1UrCAWb7unLYdaN5EJGji0xKc9ugGpuXVuSFNBiTRUdLW5kzaW3xDjgh8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGJw0YbW__lEeAbE9QCbhYhl7_bODK_E3ucwPyGwdArHg&oe=6A901C9A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Blade City Brand Assets Cover.png", "id": "1655153859945519", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310667_1655153863278852_7997685239185590787_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=coG3Haw7p7sQ7kNvwHyYMhu&_nc_oc=Adr-Nmd2aNGMQLyKK0oTFU8FYRtv2EoHjmGp3buDEzxMBFTRKfLLwfVdWwOHjoj-hN4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGf-ODSMvlXex4VouZojMGMoacow7dSp5b7yuLaWYre7Q&oe=6A901FD1"}, "display_name": "Blade City", "keywords": ["sports", "social", "sandbox", "platformer"], "long_description": "A rookie Ninja Monkey with a rusty blade, an empty wallet, and one impossible dream...to become the Master of the Blades \ud83e\udd77\n\nDodge & deflex \u2694\ufe0f in every match to win coins \ud83d\udcb0 \n\nSpend coins to upgrade blades, slay-high abilities, aura \u2728\n\nCoins also unlock mini-games across the city \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f\n\nSkate. Slice. Socialize \ud83d\udef9 \ud83c\udf54  \ud83c\udf63 \n\nGet rich\ud83d\udcb0. Get jacked \ud83d\udcaa. Throw rooftop parties \ud83c\udf89 . Flex \ud83e\udea9\n{1899581750729344}\n\n{2088024375447461}\n\nWanna help us build arena maps, blades, and expand this Ninja City? \ud83e\udd1d\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f\n\nJoin discord.gg/playbladecity\n\n{1714375429586515}", "short_description": "Become the ultimate Ninja Monkey in Blade City! \ud83e\udd77\ud83d\udc35\nYou have a blade. Everyone else has a blade. Good luck! \u2694\ufe0f"}]}, "developer_name": "Blade Lab", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Blade Lab", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/playbladecity", "website_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "1614607460665188"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2372246093265216"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2372246093265216"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1781905200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2372246093265216"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1693415469451053", "version": "1.0.13a"}, "id": "2403174663506544", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1693415469451053"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1787327760, "id": "1694016116057655", "version": "1.0.13", "version_code": 169, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1693415469451053"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2403174663506544"}]}, "change_log": " v1.0.13 \u2014 Shark Ball Update \nNew Arena \u2014 Shark Ball\n\nDive into an underwater battle where the ball has been replaced by a hungry shark!\nInstead of hitting a normal ball, you'll be sending a robotic shark chasing after your opponents.\nAvailable from your Watch \u2192 Classic Mode \u2192 Shark Ball.\n\nNew: Arena Map Voting\n\nYou can now vote for which Arena map to play!\nAfter voting for a game mode, keep an eye on your Watch. When you hear the notification sound, open it again to vote for the Arena map before the match begins.\nChoose your favorite battleground and jump in!\n\nWeekly Challenge \u2014 Final Blow\n\nLand the match-ending elimination 20 times this week.\n(Score the final elimination that wins the match.)\nReward: Crimson Pulse Edge\n\nNew Blade \u2014 Crimson Pulse Edge\n\nA sleek high-tech blade with a blazing crimson energy edge, built to stand out in every duel.\n\nNew Features\n\nFriend List\nAdd players you've met through your Watch, and quickly join them whenever they're online.\n\nUpdated Intro Screen\nThe intro experience has been refreshed.\n\nDeath Effects\nDefeating an opponent now has improved visual effects for a more satisfying finish.\n\nImprovements\n\nNighttime City\nBlade City now comes alive at night with a brand-new nighttime atmosphere.\n\nLIV Camera\n\n*  Smoother camera movement. \n*  Fixed avatar clipping and mirror issues. \n\nXP & Level Up Feedback\nImproved visual feedback to make XP gain and level ups more noticeable and rewarding.\n\nBalance Changes\n\nShockwave\nShockwave can no longer be used in the lobby.\n It still works normally inside Arena matches.", "created_date": 1787272290, "id": "1693415469451053", "version": "1.0.13a", "version_code": 166, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1693415469451053"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1787265131, "id": "1693355226123744", "version": "1.0.13a", "version_code": 165, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1693415469451053"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1787262065, "id": "1693326022793331", "version": "1.0.13a", "version_code": 164, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1693415469451053"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2403174663506544"}]}, "change_log": " v1.0.13 \u2014 Shark Ball Update \nNew Arena \u2014 Shark Ball\n\nDive into an underwater battle where the ball has been replaced by a hungry shark!\nInstead of hitting a normal ball, you'll be sending a robotic shark chasing after your opponents.\nAvailable from your Watch \u2192 Classic Mode \u2192 Shark Ball.\n\nNew: Arena Map Voting\n\nYou can now vote for which Arena map to play!\nAfter voting for a game mode, keep an eye on your Watch. When you hear the notification sound, open it again to vote for the Arena map before the match begins.\nChoose your favorite battleground and jump in!\n\nWeekly Challenge \u2014 Final Blow\n\nLand the match-ending elimination 20 times this week.\n(Score the final elimination that wins the match.)\nReward: Crimson Pulse Edge\n\nNew Blade \u2014 Crimson Pulse Edge\n\nA sleek high-tech blade with a blazing crimson energy edge, built to stand out in every duel.\n\nNew Features\n\nFriend List\nAdd players you've met through your Watch, and quickly join them whenever they're online.\n\nUpdated Intro Screen\nThe intro experience has been refreshed.\n\nDeath Effects\nDefeating an opponent now has improved visual effects for a more satisfying finish.\n\nImprovements\n\nNighttime City\nBlade City now comes alive at night with a brand-new nighttime atmosphere.\n\nLIV Camera\n\n*  Smoother camera movement. \n*  Fixed avatar clipping and mirror issues. \n\nXP & Level Up Feedback\nImproved visual feedback to make XP gain and level ups more noticeable and rewarding.\n\nBalance Changes\n\nShockwave\nShockwave can no longer be used in the lobby.\n It still works normally inside Arena matches.\n", "created_date": 1787187588, "id": "1692490509543549", "version": "1.0.13", "version_code": 163, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}